    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forget standard puzzles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Machinery 3 is your personal engineering playground where creativity knows no bounds. <br>Each challenge is a blank canvas for your engineering genius. <br>Create unique mechanisms that not only work but also inspire awe. <br>From simple machines to complex mechanisms, the only limit is your imagination. What amazing inventions will you create?<br><br>Machinery 3 comes equipped with a powerful set of tools:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutable blocks:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0441089537906d7456a6933208c07241.poster.avif?t=1741161475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0441089537906d7456a6933208c07241.webm?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0441089537906d7456a6933208c07241.mp4?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connectors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/cbd44f3ee3b43d4ec248f0a483fbb0b1.poster.avif?t=1741161475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/cbd44f3ee3b43d4ec248f0a483fbb0b1.webm?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/cbd44f3ee3b43d4ec248f0a483fbb0b1.mp4?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Motors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/f9e93f7bd2ffe66ffbe2e9b6ffe9426c.poster.avif?t=1741161475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/f9e93f7bd2ffe66ffbe2e9b6ffe9426c.webm?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/f9e93f7bd2ffe66ffbe2e9b6ffe9426c.mp4?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jet engines:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0b41b2e82c14ae41269d01ab530050f9.poster.avif?t=1741161475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0b41b2e82c14ae41269d01ab530050f9.webm?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0b41b2e82c14ae41269d01ab530050f9.mp4?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them, experiment with shapes, and build incredible constructions. <br>The game offers two viewing modes: 2D and 3D, with a consistent side-view perspective. <br>Save your assembled mechanisms to use them in other levels or simply enjoy watching your creations come to life. <br>With motors and jet engines at your disposal, it's easy to create moving and flying machines. <br>The intuitive interface for configuring motor and jet engine controls enhances gameplay in the physics simulation mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machinery 3 gives you the same tools as the game developers. <br>Design your own levels with the powerful and easy-to-use built-in editor. <br>Share your creations with other players through Steam\u00ae Workshop\u2014with just one click, you can showcase your inventions to the world and draw inspiration from other players' ideas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive and powerful editor for creating your own levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanism for configuring motor and jet engine controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits on the number of elements and mechanisms used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to change the shape of basic elements and connect them in constructions using rigid or rotating joints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to save constructions and use them in other levels; Steam\u00ae Workshop access for a potentially unlimited supply of levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forget standard puzzles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Machinery 3 is your personal engineering playground where creativity knows no bounds. <br>Each challenge is a blank canvas for your engineering genius. <br>Create unique mechanisms that not only work but also inspire awe. <br>From simple machines to complex mechanisms, the only limit is your imagination. What amazing inventions will you create?<br><br>Machinery 3 comes equipped with a powerful set of tools:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutable blocks:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0441089537906d7456a6933208c07241.poster.avif?t=1741161475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0441089537906d7456a6933208c07241.webm?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/0441089537906d7456a6933208c07241.mp4?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connectors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/cbd44f3ee3b43d4ec248f0a483fbb0b1.poster.avif?t=1741161475\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/cbd44f3ee3b43d4ec248f0a483fbb0b1.webm?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453400/extras/cbd44f3ee3b43d4ec248f0a483fbb0b1.mp4?t=1741161475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Motors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla