Design your own levels with the powerful and easy-to-use built-in editor. <br>Share your creations with other players through Steam\u00ae Workshop\u2014with just one click, you can showcase your inventions to the world and draw inspiration from other players' ideas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive and powerful editor for creating your own levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanism for configuring motor and jet engine controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits on the number of elements and mechanisms used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to change the shape of basic elements and connect them in constructions using rigid or rotating joints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to save constructions and use them in other levels; Steam\u00ae Workshop access for a potentially unlimited supply of levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
